#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Replacement Table 5: shared-original-test, matched-budget contamination ablation.

Kaggle: attach ONLY the original MSLD v2.0 dataset by joydippaul, GPU T4,
Internet ON; run this entire file. No audit-data attachment is required.
Default: five seeds, 100 epochs per condition, FP32, Adam 1e-3, batch 32.
The embedded 755-file audit is checked before any training.
This is an intentional contamination intervention, NOT Pal et al.'s exact code.
Use --check-only to verify every split without downloading model weights.
Outputs and rolling epoch checkpoints: /kaggle/working/table5_replacement/.
Small results ZIP excludes model/checkpoint .pt files. Preserve full outputs too.
"""
